# Patches are applied with `git apply` by scripts/prepare-rustpush.mjs against
# LF sources. A Windows checkout that rewrote them to CRLF would fail to apply,
# so keep their bytes verbatim on every platform.
# Unified-diff context markers on blank lines are required patch syntax, but
# look like trailing whitespace when the patch itself is added to a Git diff.
*.patch -text whitespace=-trailing-space
